{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"TodoList_43_568e50d3","function":{"name":"TodoList","arguments":"{\"todos\":[{\"title\":\"Inspect campaign state, data, and scoring code\",\"status\":\"done\"},{\"title\":\"Reproduce the starter baseline and diagnose CRPS\",\"status\":\"done\"},{\"title\":\"Run targeted volatility-calibration experiments\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"title\":\"Validate the strongest model across regimes and formats\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"title\":\"Verify serving robustness and latency\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"title\":\"Commit deliverables and nominate the champion\",\"status\":\"pending\"}]}"}},{"type":"function","id":"Write_44_3d49f2c9","function":{"name":"Write","arguments":"{\"path\":\"agent/journal.md\",\"mode\":\"append\",\"content\":\"\\n### Complete starter table\\n\\nOfficial mean CRPS at 1000 paths, latest window described above:\\n\\n| Asset | 24h CRPS | 1h CRPS |\\n|---|---:|---:|\\n| BTC | 3431.423 | 519.622 |\\n| ETH | 4459.142 | 651.352 |\\n| SOL | 5097.799 | 804.124 |\\n| XRP | 5133.495 | 943.423 |\\n| HYPE | 6112.607 | 1009.453 |\\n| XAU | 2057.948 | — |\\n| NVDAX | 5884.456 | — |\\n| GOOGLX | 4457.109 | — |\\n| TSLAX | 5967.679 | — |\\n| AAPLX | 3068.570 | — |\\n| WTIOIL | 4507.370 | — |\\n| SPCX | 7355.830 | — |\\n| SP500 | 2122.382 | — |\\n\\n## Iteration 1 — Fast EWMA variance\\n\\n**Hypothesis.** A 30-minute EWMA of squared minute returns will track the current volatility regime better than the starter's equally weighted seven-day standard deviation. The variance proxy screen favored short half-lives on every tested asset, including at forecast leads up to 24h; this is a screening result, not evidence of a CRPS gain.\\n\\n**Change.** Replace only the scale estimator with a 30-minute EWMA. Keep Gaussian log-normal increments, seven-day context, and the same path contract. Seed Python and NumPy generators from `SYNTH_BENCHMARK_SEED`, with a fixed fallback for local runs. Drop invalid returns across NaN gaps instead of differencing across them. Test BTC, XAU, and BTC-1h first on the starter window; retain only if the gain is material, then check a disjoint older window.\\n\\n**Result.** Pending.\\n\\n**Verdict.** Pending.\\n\\n**Lesson.** Pending.\\n\"}"}},{"type":"function","id":"Write_45_3e78a51d","function":{"name":"Write","arguments":"{\"path\":\"agent/modeling.py\",\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"Probabilistic price paths calibrated from the supplied minute context.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nimport os\\nimport random\\n\\nimport numpy as np\\n\\nCONTEXT_DAYS = 7\\nVOL_HALFLIFE_MINUTES = 30.0\\n\\n\\ndef _minute_variance(closes: np.ndarray) -> float:\\n    valid_prices = closes[np.isfinite(closes) & (closes > 0)]\\n    if valid_prices.size < 11:\\n        return 5e-4**2\\n    clean = closes.copy()\\n    clean[~np.isfinite(clean) | (clean <= 0)] = np.nan\\n    rets = np.diff(np.log(clean))\\n    rets = rets[np.isfinite(rets)]\\n    if rets.size < 10:\\n        return 5e-4**2\\n    alpha = 1.0 - np.exp(np.log(0.5) / VOL_HALFLIFE_MINUTES)\\n    initial = rets[: min(rets.size, 1440)]\\n    level = float(np.mean(initial * initial))\\n    for ret in rets:\\n        level += alpha * (ret * ret - level)\\n    return max(level, 1e-12)\\n\\n\\ndef simulate(\\n    asset: str,\\n    start_time,\\n    time_increment: int = 300,\\n    time_length: int = 86_400,\\n    num_simulations: int = 1000,\\n    context_prices=None,\\n):\\n    seed = int(os.environ.get(\\\"SYNTH_BENCHMARK_SEED\\\", \\\"20261108\\\"))\\n    random.seed(seed)\\n    np.random.seed(seed)\\n    rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\\n\\n    closes = context_prices[\\\"close\\\"].to_numpy(dtype=float)\\n    valid = closes[np.isfinite(closes) & (closes > 0)]\\n    last = float(valid[-1]) if valid.size else 1.0\\n    minute_variance = _minute_variance(closes)\\n    step_sigma = np.sqrt(minute_variance * time_increment / 60.0)\\n    steps = time_length // time_increment\\n    shocks = rng.normal(0.0, step_sigma, size=(num_simulations, steps))\\n    log_paths = np.concatenate(\\n        [np.zeros((num_simulations, 1)), np.cumsum(shocks, axis=1)], axis=1\\n    )\\n    paths = last * np.exp(log_paths)\\n    return (start_time, time_increment, *[p.tolist() for p in paths])\\n\"}"}}]}
