 leaving the default at 30 minutes. Compare 15 and 60 minutes against the completed 30-minute results on BTC, SOL, and XRP in both latest and October windows. Broaden only a setting that wins consistently.\\n\\n**Result.** Pending.\\n\\n**Verdict.** Pending.\\n\\n**Lesson.** Pending.\\n\"}"}},{"type":"function","id":"Edit_167_c3e94dea","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"agent/modeling.py\",\"old_string\":\"VOL_HALFLIFE_MINUTES = 30.0\\n\",\"new_string\":\"VOL_HALFLIFE_MINUTES = float(os.environ.get(\\\"SYNTH_VOL_HALFLIFE_MINUTES\\\", \\\"30\\\"))\\n\"}"}}]}
