{"role":"assistant","content":"The context sweep favors 14 days: latest results are essentially unchanged, while September BTC and TSLAX improve about 2.5%. Thirty days adds strong older BTC gains but regresses latest XAU and TSLAX, so I’m validating 14 days broadly rather than chasing the larger but less stable 30-day result.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"Edit_221_3bb43a41","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"agent/journal.md\",\"old_string\":\"**Change.** Compare `CONTEXT_DAYS = 14` and 30 against the completed seven-day no-calendar mixture on BTC, XAU, and TSLAX in latest and September windows. Disable the calendar for every arm so only context length changes. The 1h path is screened separately only if a longer context wins for 24h.\\n\\n**Result.** Pending.\\n\\n**Verdict.** Pending.\\n\\n**Lesson.** Pending.\\n\",\"new_string\":\"**Change.** Compare `CONTEXT_DAYS = 14` and 30 against the completed seven-day no-calendar mixture on BTC, XAU, and TSLAX in latest and September windows. Disable the calendar for every arm so only context length changes. The 1h path is screened separately only if a longer context wins for 24h.\\n\\n**Result.** Fourteen days, latest versus seven days: BTC 3305.475 (+0.13%), XAU 1991.164 (+0.10%), TSLAX 5670.702 (−0.06%). September: BTC 2356.002 (−2.52%), XAU 1207.757 (−0.22%), TSLAX 1574.620 (−2.50%). Thirty days, latest: BTC 3284.447 (−0.51%), XAU 2000.675 (+0.58%), TSLAX 5717.753 (+0.77%). September: BTC 2262.829 (−6.38%), XAU 1208.131 (−0.19%), TSLAX 1567.733 (−2.93%).\\n\\n**Verdict.** Keep 14 days provisionally and validate it across all assets. Discard 30 days: its larger older BTC gain does not offset the two material latest-window regressions. No 1h context change yet.\\n\\n**Lesson.** More history helps most in the older low-volatility regime, where the seven-day model was too wide. The latest window penalizes slow adaptation, so 14 days is a safer bias–variance compromise than 30.\\n\"}"}}]}
