{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"Edit_229_e17a7835","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"agent/journal.md\",\"old_string\":\"Validate on the late NFP window, September CPI/FOMC, October CPI/FOMC and earnings, and require no-event predictions to remain exactly unchanged. The 1h path is unchanged in this iteration.\\n\\n**Result.** Pending.\\n\\n**Verdict.** Pending.\\n\\n**Lesson.** Pending.\\n\",\"new_string\":\"Validate on the late NFP window, September CPI/FOMC, October CPI/FOMC and earnings, and require no-event predictions to remain exactly unchanged. The 1h path is unchanged in this iteration.\\n\\n**Result.** Calendar-on versus paired calendar-off mean CRPS: late NFP BTC 3302.084 versus 3301.220 (+0.03%), XAU 1988.711 versus 1989.245 (−0.03%); September CPI/FOMC BTC 2510.958 versus 2516.813 (−0.23%), XAU 1628.861 versus 1634.817 (−0.36%); October CPI BTC 2946.521 versus 2953.694 (−0.24%), XAU 1552.900 versus 1562.349 (−0.61%); isolated FOMC BTC 2410.903 versus 2413.535 (−0.11%), XAU 1466.365 versus 1469.733 (−0.23%); TSLAX earnings 4208.532 versus 4260.796 (−1.23%); GOOGLX earnings/FOMC 3889.265 versus 3964.111 (−1.89%). The no-event control reproduced 2416.9562832921156 exactly.\\n\\n**Verdict.** Keep the calendar multipliers. Nine of ten late-validation cells improved; earnings had the largest effect, and the only regression was 0.03% on NFP BTC. No-event behavior is unchanged.\\n\\n**Lesson.** Conservative, localized event scaling generalizes better than broad event-day inflation. The publishable negative result is equally important: EIA, retail sales, PPI, and collinear GDP/PCE did not have stable enough effects to include.\\n\"}"}},{"type":"function","id":"Bash_230_42251b33","function":{"name":"Bash","arguments":"{\"command\":\"for asset in BTC ETH SOL XRP HYPE; do SYNTH_1H_BLOCK_MINUTES=60 uv run agent/predict.py --asset \\\"$asset\\\" --days 2 --eval-end 2026-11-08 --time-length 3600 --time-increment 60 --num-simulations 1000 --latest-formula; done\",\"cwd\":\"/workspace\",\"timeout\":300,\"run_in_background\":true,\"description\":\"60-minute block bootstrap all-asset latest\"}"}},{"type":"function","id":"Bash_231_bab0c60a","function":{"name":"Bash","arguments":"{\"command\":\"for asset in BTC ETH SOL XRP HYPE; do SYNTH_1H_BLOCK_MINUTES=60 uv run agent/predict.py --asset \\\"$asset\\\" --days 2 --eval-end 2026-10-01 --time-length 3600 --time-increment 60 --num-simulations 1000 --latest-formula; done\",\"cwd\":\"/workspace\",\"timeout\":300,\"run_in_background\":true,\"description\":\"60-minute block bootstrap all-asset October\"}"}}]}
