{"role":"assistant","content":"The 14-day context has a small older 1h regression, mainly HYPE, but there is a clean fix: serve 14 days to 24h and slice the last seven days inside the 1h path. The 15-minute block is neutral on average in October and improves all five latest assets, so I’m testing antithetic sampling on that structure.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"Edit_280_ff8bb906","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"agent/modeling.py\",\"old_string\":\"    closes = context_prices[\\\"close\\\"].to_numpy(dtype=float)\\n    valid = closes[np.isfinite(closes) & (closes > 0)]\\n\",\"new_string\":\"    if time_length == 3600:\\n        context_prices = context_prices.iloc[-7 * 1440 :]\\n    closes = context_prices[\\\"close\\\"].to_numpy(dtype=float)\\n    valid = closes[np.isfinite(closes) & (closes > 0)]\\n\"}"}}]}
