{"role":"assistant","content":"The modeling choices are now narrow: 14-day 24h context with a seven-day 1h slice, empirical/Gaussian 24h mixture, 30-minute 1h EWMA, 15-minute residual blocks, and antithetic sampling. I’m documenting the failed alternatives and the remaining final checks while the last event and sampling comparisons run.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"Write_286_9e3ad8ee","function":{"name":"Write","arguments":"{\"path\":\"agent/suggestions.md\",\"content\":\"# Suggestions\\n\\n- Expose the official per-prompt price-CRPS and volatility-CRPS components in `BacktestResult.prompt_df`. The current total is sufficient for scoring, but a breakdown would make crypto-1h path-calibration experiments much easier to diagnose without modifying the backtester.\\n- Include a small machine-readable summary and per-prompt output option in the standard evaluation CLI. The `--result-stem` addition in this workspace is one possible interface; making it standard would help miners compare paired experiments without keeping multi-gigabyte prediction files.\\n- No operator-private miner models or other out-of-scope model artifacts were encountered or used.\\n\"}"}},{"type":"function","id":"Edit_287_aed1bd66","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"agent/predict.py\",\"old_string\":\"fewer sampled paths, and the real field's CRPS was computed at 1000).\\n\\nThe context a prompt gets ends BEFORE its start_time, and that is not an off-by-one. The store\\n\",\"new_string\":\"fewer sampled paths, and the real field's CRPS was computed at 1000).\\n--result-stem PATH saves the summary as JSON and per-prompt scores as parquet. SYNTH_MODELING_PATH\\nselects an alternate model for paired research runs; it defaults to agent/modeling.py.\\n\\nThe context a prompt gets ends BEFORE its start_time, and that is not an off-by-one. The store\\n\"}"}}]}
