{"role":"assistant","content":"All research questions are resolved. The final 1h event tests improve every NFP, CPI, and FOMC cell; antithetic sampling improves eight of ten 1h cells, with the two exceptions below 0.05%. I’m freezing these choices, removing research switches, and starting the final paired validation.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"TodoList_305_b9310024","function":{"name":"TodoList","arguments":"{\"todos\":[{\"title\":\"Inspect campaign state, data, and scoring code\",\"status\":\"done\"},{\"title\":\"Reproduce the starter baseline and diagnose CRPS\",\"status\":\"done\"},{\"title\":\"Run targeted volatility-calibration experiments\",\"status\":\"done\"},{\"title\":\"Validate the strongest model across regimes and formats\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"title\":\"Verify serving robustness and latency\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"title\":\"Commit deliverables and nominate the champion\",\"status\":\"pending\"}]}"}},{"type":"function","id":"Read_306_2a51204a","function":{"name":"Read","arguments":"{\"path\":\"agent/modeling.py\"}"}},{"type":"function","id":"Edit_307_b3201f44","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"agent/journal.md\",\"old_string\":\"**Result.** Pending.\\n\\n**Verdict.** Pending.\\n\\n**Lesson.** Pending.\\n\",\"new_string\":\"**Result.** Late NFP with event scaling versus independent empirical: BTC 447.701 versus 448.124, ETH 570.047 versus 570.580, SOL 732.905 versus 732.936, XRP 932.595 versus 933.164, HYPE 917.802 versus 917.992; all five improved by 0.004–0.094%. October CPI calendar-off/on: BTC 721.305/719.761, SOL 1251.433/1249.002, XRP 1129.384/1126.677, gains of 0.19–0.24%. October FOMC: BTC 645.634/645.335, SOL 1028.255/1027.333, XRP 967.147/966.531, gains of 0.05–0.09%.\\n\\n**Verdict.** Keep 1h macro-event scaling. Every late-validation cell improved, although the average effect is small. The 24h event helper's five-minute profile entries remain unchanged in behavior.\\n\\n**Lesson.** Scheduled events provide a repeatable small gain after core calibration. As with 24h, broad session seasonality is harmful while narrow event timing is useful.\\n\\n## Iteration 13 — Frozen champion and paired final validation\\n\\n**Hypothesis.** The independently validated components should compose into a lower-CRPS model on both formats without sacrificing robustness or latency.\\n\\n**Change.** Freeze a 14-day context for 24h with a seven-day 1h slice; New York-time seasonal variance and a 50/50 empirical/Gaussian residual mixture for 24h; 30-minute EWMA scale, independent empirical residuals in 15-minute blocks for 1h; early-fit event multipliers on both; and antithetic sampling on both. Remove all research-only behavior switches. Validate the exact frozen file against the starter at 1000 paths on identical 10-day 24h and 5-day 1h windows ending 2026-11-08.\\n\\nThe 1h antithetic check on 15-minute blocks improved eight of ten cells. Latest BTC/ETH/SOL were 444.046/564.242/728.659; October BTC/ETH/SOL were 596.457/731.515/1051.984. The only regressions were latest XRP +0.04% and HYPE +0.03%; both improved in October, to 1190.174 and 1282.064, respectively.\\n\\n**Result.** Pending final paired runs.\\n\\n**Verdict.** Pending.\\n\\n**Lesson.** Pending.\\n\"}"}}]}
