{"role":"assistant","content":"Research campaign completed and champion nominated in `agent/CHAMPION`.\n\n| Configuration | Starter CRPS | Champion CRPS | Change |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| CRYPTO_24H | 4607.927 | 4494.773 | **−2.46%** |\n| COM_EQU_24H | 3304.762 | 3119.334 | **−5.61%** |\n| CRYPTO_1H | 979.258 | 942.752 | **−3.73%** |\n\nOfficial synth-lib results at 1000 paths show improvement on **all 18 assets**, with 100% realized coverage.\n\nThe champion combines regime-aware volatility, New York-time seasonality, empirical residual sampling, short volatility blocks, event multipliers, and antithetic sampling. It supports both 24h and 1h formats and passed the harness interface, NaN, missing-calendar, path-count, finiteness, and seed-reproducibility checks.\n\nDeliverables are committed:\n- Model commit: `933c67a`\n- Nomination commit: `3a5df4c`\n- Research details: `agent/journal.md`\n- Miner-facing report: `agent/report.md`\n- Community suggestions: `agent/suggestions.md`"}
